    <h1>What is Ayurveda? A beginner's guide</h1><p class="dek">A simple introduction to one of the world's oldest wellness traditions — and where single-ingredient herbs fit in.</p>
    <div class="ba-author"><img src="{{ 'mark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="170" height="145" loading="eager"><span><b>Written by Team Veda</b><time datetime="2026-10-06">Oct 06, 2026</time></span></div>
